        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "@rauchg @nextjs Exit criteria is the part most teams skip, and agents make skipping it more expensive because they'll happily build toward a vague goal. Our product studio runs on the same rule. KPIs get set before anything is built and there's a go/no-go every month, so you can kill a bad bet",
      "url": "https://x.com/GregMoranX/status/2122809993850236994"
    },
    {
