      },
      "text": "@rauchg @nextjs Exit criteria is the part most people skip. When I hand an agent a job, most of the spec is what done looks like and how it should check its own work. The code part got easy. Deciding when to stop is still the human job.",
      "url": "https://x.com/sivunigunta/status/2122809222480179585"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "957859662547730432",
      "conversation_id": "2122746777376006400",
