        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "@rauchg @nextjs Spec-first is the one part of the autonomy loop nobody can automate away — and it is the part most teams skip. I have watched agents build exactly what was asked and still miss, because the spec was a vibe. Who owns the spec when the agent writes the code?Spec-first is the one",
      "url": "https://x.com/kukukila0/status/2122808187107876904"
    },
